---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="AI Tools | TechPilot AI" description="Learn how AI tools work, what they are useful for, and how to evaluate them.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Explore the landscape</span>
    <h1>AI tools, <span style="color:var(--mint)">made clearer.</span></h1>
    <p>AI can help with writing, research, design, coding, and more. Start here to understand the categories, compare options, and choose tools that fit your needs.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="notice">Our guides are educational and independent. AI tools change frequently, so always verify current features, prices, privacy terms, and usage limits on the provider's official website.</div>
  <div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Explore by task</h2><p>Start with the problem you want to solve.</p></div></div>
  <section class="card-grid">
    <article class="content-card"><span class="card-icon">✍</span><span class="card-tag">Writing</span><h3>Writing & editing assistants</h3><p>Explore drafting, summarizing, brainstorming, and editing workflows while keeping your own voice and judgment.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card"><span class="card-icon">⌕</span><span class="card-tag">Research</span><h3>Research & learning</h3><p>Learn how AI research assistants can organize information, explain concepts, and help you check sources.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card"><span class="card-icon">▧</span><span class="card-tag">Creative</span><h3>Image & design tools</h3><p>Understand image generation, visual editing, licensing questions, and practical creative workflows.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card"><span class="card-icon">⌘</span><span class="card-tag">Development</span><h3>Coding assistants</h3><p>Discover how coding tools can help explain code, suggest fixes, and speed up repetitive development tasks.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card"><span class="card-icon">◷</span><span class="card-tag">Productivity</span><h3>Automation & productivity</h3><p>Find ways to reduce repetitive work and connect your everyday apps, with care around sensitive data.</p></article>
    <article class="content-card"><span class="card-icon">◎</span><span class="card-tag">Decision guide</span><h3>Choosing an AI tool</h3><p>Evaluate output quality, privacy, accessibility, cost, and the amount of human review a tool requires.</p></article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
